{"title":"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e137a585dc18a5612b4ef6e8297abdca3c6eb2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> be the units digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/4/314149be9582842c3e8efe75b62a4f32fc1d3463.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 + \\dots + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"116\" height=\"13\" />. Find the remainder when\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/5/c25a797fd18625aea3a70ae1b6906027405232ff.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{n=1}^{2017} d_n\\]\" width=\"46\" height=\"50\" />is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e137a585dc18a5612b4ef6e8297abdca3c6eb2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> appears in cycles of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the cycles are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/b/78b3ef83b37bec9ad8bb199f6c02360123c5e907.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1,3,6,0,5,1,8,6,5,5,6,8,1,5,0,6,3,1,0,0,\\]\" width=\"338\" height=\"16\" /> adding a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> each cycle.\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daab461ecb9d3e369025a346560cdc7104b504f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor\\frac{2017}{20}\\right\\rfloor=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"112\" height=\"43\" />, we know that by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/1/5617f6d8def6056c5921630439d64b56cfa519ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />, there have been <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> cycles and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/a/6ea873bc6a6f96885c23773510f9011fa5c03bce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7000$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> has been added. This can be discarded as we're just looking for the last three digits.\nAdding up the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> of the cycle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we can see that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/c/70cdf1604bee9c8a788408aaf5a9d933db44d12d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{069}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<pre>~ Maths_Is_Hard\n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BiiKzctXDJg\">https://youtu.be/BiiKzctXDJg</a> ~ Shrea S\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I\" title=\"2017 AIME I\">2017 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2017\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2017 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 202610180026